Package: causallinkage
Title: Exact Randomization Inference with Uncertain Record Identities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exact Fisher p-value endpoints, attaining linkages, and identity
    breakdown budgets for completely randomized experiments whose assignment
    and outcome files are linked through a candidate graph and an identity-error
    budget.
